  "question": "Which viewpoint is closest when moving in the south direction from Wildlife Sanctuary, Irvine, CA?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-117.838861 33.669618)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois,origin\nWHERE pois.tourism = 'viewpoint'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 157.5 AND 202.5\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> origin.geometry ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
